    "details": {
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 3
      },
      "disable": "<ul>\n<li>@Check[type:diplomacy|dc:23|name: To Soothe Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (trained) Twice To Soothe Spirit</li>\n<li>@Check[type:religion|dc:20|name: To Quiet Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (expert) <span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Twice </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">To Quiet Spirit</span></li>\n<li>@Check[type:occultism|dc:20|name: To Quiet Spirit|traits:complex,haunt] (expert)&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Twice </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">To Quiet Spirit</span></li>\n</ul>",
      "description": "<p>A horrific shriek fills the room as the scarf flies into the air.</p>\n<p><strong>Vengful Haunt</strong>: This Haunt only affects those haunted by Jescha Foxglove, Alderns murdered wife who desires vengance for their murder. If no creatures in a group are haunted by Jescha Foxglove this haunt may target any creature.</p>",
      "reset": "<p>This Haunt automatically resets enter 1 day until the supernatural fungus in B37 is dealt with, even if the haunt was previously disabled.</p>",
      "routine": "<p><strong>Routine</strong> The haunt moves toward its target and wrap around his Neck useing its choke Action, continuing to strangle the victim until dead.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Choke&nbsp;</strong><strong style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span class=\"pf2-icon\">R</span></strong></strong><span style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trigger</strong><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">: Haunted Creature gets within 5 feet of&nbsp; the carf while it reamins on manord ground. Scarf rolls a stealth against targets perseption DC. On a success the scarf wraps itself around targets neck.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">Strangle: The Scaf's next action is to strangle the target, who must make a </span><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">&nbsp;@Check[type:will|dc:26|name:Suggestion|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult]save with the following results:&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Critical Success:</strong>&nbsp;no effect&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Success:</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened}&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Failure:</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}</li>\n<li><strong>Critical Failure:</strong> @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed}.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-14);\">The scarfs next action ist to strangle the target who must make a @Check[type:fort|dc:22|traits:mental,incapacitating,linguistic,necromancy,occult] save or recieve [[/r (2d8+7)[nonlethal]]]{2d8+7 nonlethal damage}. This repeats until the target is dead or the scarf is disabled or broken.</span></p>",
